ck new rat abilities and new lab tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706190/extras/1e9b6bfe5d4e7434a5d3c654cd07e397.poster.avif?t=1747146628\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706190/extras/1e9b6bfe5d4e7434a5d3c654cd07e397.webm?t=1747146628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706190/extras/1e9b6bfe5d4e7434a5d3c654cd07e397.mp4?t=1747146628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Observe as the rats grapple with their purpose</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Occasionally, rats will exchange dialogue with one another. They will support one another and try their best to assist their new human friend. What will they do when they are forced to choose between the purpose laid before them and the livelihood of their brethren?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706190/extras/1ec7f095740a4c820933cd20511ba91e.poster.avif?t=1747146628\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706190/extras/1ec7f095740a4c820933cd20511ba91e.webm?t=1747146628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706190/extras/1ec7f095740a4c820933cd20511ba91e.mp4?t=1747146628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
